      "body": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Carbon atom ka environment us se seedhe jure atoms ki qismon se tay hota hai. Aik environment ke carbon atoms chemically equivalent hain aur un ki chemical shift aik hai: ethane ke dono carbons barabar hain. Mukhtalif environments ke carbon atoms non-equivalent hain aur mukhtalif chemical shifts par aate hain: 2-methylpropane, (CH3)3CH, mein teen methyl carbons ka aik environment hai jab ke markazi carbon ka mukhtalif. Environment ki qism har carbon ke gird atoms ya bonds se predict ki ja sakti hai."
          },
